    {
      "id": "45931617-e3ed-58f1-85b0-036bb40d22b3",
      "key": "liu-he-pagoda.river",
      "name": "六和塔与钱塘江",
      "introduction": {
        "schemaVersion": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "六和塔立在钱塘江岸边，塔、江、潮与地平线合成秩序。逐层向上时江面渐远，观塔与观江互证：塔是垂直的度量，江是水平的界面，二者在同一处高差下生成塔和江的关系。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "culturalElementId": "595dfab1-6ed3-5353-a07b-174e37f2f5d2",
      "attractionId": "1196fa4a-fef1-565d-8859-236b2b1a02d4",
      "latitude": 30.196338,
      "longitude": 120.131487,
      "coordinateSourceUrl": "https://ditu.amap.com/place/B023B0E7F4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a0559c41-e08b-56cf-ac30-ab7afb8002bc",
      "key": "liu-he-pagoda.tide",
      "name": "六和塔下的观潮",
      "introduction": {
        "schemaVersion": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "钱塘江潮在农历八月前后最盛，江面能被一道高耸水线压过。在六和塔一带远观潮线，先听见声、再看见潮，潮、江、塔与风在彼此呼应；观潮要选择稳定观察点，不必贴近追逐。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "culturalElementId": "10d8faa1-921b-5786-93ff-dd9a6c00d5ba",
      "attractionId": "1196fa4a-fef1-565d-8859-236b2b1a02d4",
      "latitude": 30.196338,
      "longitude": 120.131487,
      "coordinateSourceUrl": "https://ditu.amap.com/place/B023B0E7F4"
    },
    {
      "id": "645df489-8732-5a9c-b30e-25e0cd460941",
      "key": "xiling-seal.society",
      "name": "西泠印社的孤山空间",
      "introduction": {
        "schemaVersion": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "西泠印社把印章、金石与孤山庭园连成一体，是西湖文人传统的方寸之地。穿过亭廊看湖山，再回看石印与碑刻，体会“方寸之间见天地”的观看方式。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "culturalElementId": "e0f6d64b-c019-542c-a6fc-859f6f94ffd0",
