    {
      "id": "1f70a910-ede2-5b09-8738-1ebe6b8d16ba",
      "key": "su-causeway.iodine-bridges",
      "name": "苏堤六桥与移步",
      "introduction": {
        "schemaVersion": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "苏堤由六桥（映波、锁澜、望山、压堤、东浦、跨虹）串起的六处停顿；每过一座桥，湖面与山影随桥孔切出一格新的画面。苏堤真正的『春晓』是一场沿堤而行的步移景异。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "culturalElementId": "085b790e-08f7-5811-8073-8c996202b225",
      "attractionId": "bad747f4-43a2-5202-8274-d549c7c45887",
      "latitude": 30.245833,
      "longitude": 120.133472,
      "coordinateSourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Su_Causeway"
    },
    {
      "id": "66d77009-6c39-55f1-bf0a-c3b74da75910",
      "key": "su-causeway.urn",
      "name": "苏堤的水利与植柳",
      "introduction": {
        "schemaVersion": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "苏堤本来是苏轼挖湖泥筑成，堤上植柳与桃花，既挡浪又护岸，行人的行走与水的治理合而为一。水利营造与湖岸景观在苏堤上是同一条路线。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "culturalElementId": "89a21706-5676-56aa-ab3c-6ab2b48991d8",
